flowchart TB
    U[用户 / AI Agent] --> IDE[轻量IDE宿主 / 原生编辑器]
    IDE --> HA[Host Adapter]
    HA --> ES[Document Session]
    ES --> CB[Command Bus / Edit Transaction]
    ES --> SI[Markdown Structure Index]
    CB --> HA
    SI --> OUT[Outline / Reference / Diagnostics]
    U --> TP[Tool Palette / Slash / Shortcut]
    TP --> CB
    ES -.用户显式开启.-> PM[Preview Manager]
    PM --> RV[可选只读 WebView / HTML]
    RV -.按需.-> MM[Mermaid / Math]
    U --> PR[Plugin Registry / Manifest Only]
    PR -.执行时启动.-> PX[隔离Plugin Worker]
    PX --> CB
    ES -.按需.-> EXT[Git / AI / Trace / Export adapters]
    classDef core fill:#dceaff,stroke:#4175a6,color:#1b3556;
    classDef lazy fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#94a3b8,color:#334155;
    class IDE,HA,ES,CB,SI,TP,PR core;
    class PM,RV,MM,PX,EXT lazy;
